# 🐧 Tropsi X Kernel

A clean, independent Non-GKI kernel for the OnePlus kona platform, based on ppajda's XTD kernel.

**Telegram:** https://t.me/TropsiXKernel
**XDA Thread:** https://xdaforums.com/t/kernel-4-19-op8-pro-t-tropsi_x-vx-x-custom-kernelsu.4794907/

---

> ⚠️ Flashing a custom kernel carries risk of instability, bootloops, or other issues. You flash at your own risk — the maintainer is not responsible for any damage to your device.

---

## About

Built with a full LLVM toolchain and tuned for a snappier, more efficient daily-driver experience.

**Branch:** `sm8250_t_13.1_op8`

---

## ✨ Features

- Neutron Clang 19.0.0 + Neutron LLD (full LLVM, no GCC)
- KernelSU support baked in
- Zen I/O scheduler
- ZRAM swap tuned to 4GB with LZ4 compression
- Input boost frequency and duration tuning
- Westwood TCP congestion control

---

## 📱 Supported Devices

OnePlus 8, 8 Pro, 8T, 9R

---

## 📥 Installation

1. Grab the latest build from the Releases page.
2. Flash via custom recovery (AnyKernel3 zip) or Fastboot.
3. Reboot.

---

